      "conversion": "@Redirect: the COLLIDER + Fluid.NONE probes of WallSurface.clip, SupportSearch.deck / find / clear / valid and WallSqueeze.crouchOffset go through touchnmotion_ground_probe_direct's direct probe (TnmProbe; nothing without that switch); the floor probes of a render frame (GameRenderer.render HEAD @Inject marks the switch applied) read each block once into a per-frame, per-level memo (BlockPos.asLong -> state, collision shape for the collision context object it was made with, outline shape), cleared at frame end; TerrainBalance.floor's getBlockState of the hit block gets the probe's read and its fence / wall / gate getShape is made once per block and frame (@Redirect of both calls). Runtime flag touchnmotionPoseBlockMemo (shadow .shadow). Helpers bons.furious.patch.touchnmotion_c49.TnmMemo, TnmProbe, TnmFrame.",
      "license": "GPL-3.0 (Touch'n Motion): none of its code is carried; the redirects only route its probes and keep block reads"
